          "abridged": false,
          "description": "Join Duchess and her three kittens - Toulouse, Marie, and Berlioz - as they journey across Paris with the charming alley cat Thomas O’Malley. After being taken far from home by a greedy butler, the family teams up with jazzy feline friends to find their way back. With lively music and the classic “Ev’rybody Wants to Be a Cat,” The Aristocats is a playful, heartwarming adventure for all ages.",
